+MC (PlusMC) — Native Plugin API license
=========================================

The +MC **server core** (everything under the repo root except the plugin API and third-party
data) is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 — see ./LICENSE.

The **native plugin API** (the ABI headers and SDK that plugin authors compile against,
planned at src/pluginapi/) is dual-licensed under **MIT OR Apache-2.0**, mirroring PumpkinMC's
plugin ecosystem so plugin authors can ship closed-source plugins and pick whichever license
suits them.

- Apache License 2.0: full text at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt
- MIT License: full text at https://opensource.org/license/mit

Files in the plugin-API tree will carry an SPDX header, e.g.:

    // SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0

The canonical license texts will be vendored into src/pluginapi/ when that code lands
(roadmap Phase 6 in docs/PLAN.md).

Third-party data (extracted Mojang data, mappings, etc.) is NOT covered by either license —
see NOTICE.md.
